entry.summary:
Bugs that crash your app are easy to notice. The dangerous ones keep running… silently. Here is a real example: order.status = "paid";
No crash. With a runtime invariant: invariant("order.status === 'paid' -> order.invoiceId != null");
This fails immediately — exactly when the logic breaks. GitHub repository: https://github.com/vortexshadow678-hash/invariant-js
